{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃーん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の頃は\nひめたん&まあや&なぁちゃん\nで一緒に通ってたの覚えてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルの部屋もよく三人一緒だったよねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもメンバー皆で高い坂道上っていこうにねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"坂道はまだまだ上があるみたいですよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんのblogみて感動したわぁ...。 よっしゃーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやも強くなるけんなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきやでぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今だから言うよ.................."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんの大阪弁にはいつも\n萌えてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに............\n隣にいたら絶対腕を組んできたりするとこもっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも宜しくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また泊まりにいきますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前友達と遊んだ時に四葉のクローバーを見つけたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てー!!!\n四葉のクローバー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達の弟の赤ちゃんの手！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛すぎるぜっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは水風船してたくさん遊んだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃめちゃ濡れたぁ！ぬ\nまたあそぼうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお菓子とオムライス を作ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『キッフエルン』\nを作ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーストラリアやドイツの伝統的な食べ物だそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......材料......\n☆無塩バター\n100グラム\n☆粉糖\n45グラム\n☆薄力粉\n60グラム\n☆コーンスターチ\n60グラム\n☆アーモンドプードル\n60g"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......仕上げ......\n☆粉糖"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......下準備......\n☆バターを温室にもどす\n☆粉糖をふるっておく\n☆オーブンを160℃〜170℃にアタタメテおく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......作り方......\n1、バターをクリーム状に練り、粉糖を2〜3回で入れて白っぽくなるまで混ぜる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2、ふるっておいた、粉糖をまぜ、ゴムベラで、さっくりと、粉がなくなるまで混ぜる！\n※てが疲れるけどがんばるんだよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3、出来た生地をまとめて、\n冷蔵庫で１時間くらい休ませる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※１時間の間に、お皿洗いをしたり、デートPVをみたりしてねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4、冷蔵庫からだして、形にして、オーブンで１６０〜１７０℃で２０分くらい焼き、あついうちに粉糖をまぶす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ美味しいよー！\n料理できない人手ー挙げてー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが作ってあげる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっつもんたーいむ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近作った美味しい物は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/2687019/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}